WEBVTT

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.700
Do you like me?

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.910
Um, well...

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.330
I like you, Haida.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.040
RAGE

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.750
Hey.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:51.540
So, you couldn't tell her
you like her, huh?

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:53.290
Yeah.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:02:00.160
She probably found Retsuko's handkerchief
on the sink, worked out she'd been there,

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.620
and was deeply hurt.

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:06.370
This is a red card right here.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:10.790
This is the result of you flip-flopping
over your feelings for Retsuko.

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.870
I don't know what to say.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.750
Don't you think a red card is a bit harsh?

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:17.950
Huh, what are you doing here?

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:20.660
Love Police, reporting for duty.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:26.660
I think he's fine,
although he does deserve a yellow card.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.330
Wait, Inui said the same thing.

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.790
"It's fine for now."

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:36.500
Inui said that?
What's that supposed to mean?

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.160
In other words,

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:43.040
it's a tricky situation in which
neither knows where the other stands.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.120
It's one step
before an official relationship.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.290
PROVISIONAL CONTRACT

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.410
<i>However, the time</i>
<i>just before becoming official</i>

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.250
<i>is the most enjoyable of all,</i>

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:54.160
<i>full of hopes for the future</i>
<i>and the essence of love!</i>

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.700
-Get it?
-No.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:56.950
You wouldn't.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:01.870
While savoring these sweet moments,
Inui was proactive and took charge,

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.080
leading you to the next stage.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.080
<i>Wait, she led me?</i>

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.910
Did you think you were leading?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:10.830
I did.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:11.870
I bet you did.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.750
<i>Now we get to your half-hearted behavior.</i>

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:18.250
<i>Inui thinks, "Geez, he's hopeless.</i>
<i>I'm not getting anywhere."</i>

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:21.500
<i>So she changed her plans</i>
<i>and threw a straight ball.</i>

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.790
"Do you like me?"
There. That's where we are.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:27.330
Do you understand what that means?

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:30.450
Huh... It means she's fed up
with Haida, right?

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.250
Wrong.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.700
<i>She wants to be with Haida no matter what.</i>

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.040
Aw, Inui is so adorable!

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:40.910
Do you understand?

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.450
Why are you asking me?

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.830
-How did I do?
-So good!

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.330
-How was that?
-So good!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.500
Shut up!

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.290
You're disturbing the neighbors. Be quiet.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:17.450
But we were only having
a death voice battle.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.000
That's all.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.410
"Death voice"? What's that?

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:23.910
-You don't know?
-Lame.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:27.790
This is death voice. See?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.830
Super cute, right?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:35.330
We're practicing
what we learned from this video.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:40.040
She's being secretive about it,
but she's obviously from OTM.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.580
I think we're the only ones in Saitama
that have picked up on it.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.700
What's this OTM thing?

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.120
-You don't know?
-Lame.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:53.370
They're only
the sickest idol group around right now!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.250
<i>In a dark underground</i>
<i>Cut off from all light</i>

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:56.750
<i>Covering up the wound</i>
<i>That’s been gouged at</i>

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:01.160
<i>Everyone must go on up a lonely path</i>
<i>Of being different</i>

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:04.250
<i>Go where that voice reaches someone</i>

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:05.950
<i>Even if the light</i>
<i>Is just a little blinding</i>

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:11.290
<i>I’ll show you a word that is different</i>
<i>From all that you know</i>

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:16.700
<i>Hear my prayers, grant my desires</i>
<i>I promise I won’t be a spoiled brat</i>

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:23.540
<i>Let me be that one speck of a miracle</i>

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.950
You knew?

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.080
ACCOUNTING DEPARTMENT

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:41.330
Both of my daughters share
a rather peculiar hobby.

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:44.330
Recently, they've become hooked
on underground idols.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:50.580
They seem to be fans of yours.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.910
158 yen, 125 yen,

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.830
490 yen.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.000
That will be 1,139 yen.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:08.000
Manaka.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:09.830
Yes?

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:14.290
It's been a while,
but I took a look at OTM's account today.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.540
You've gained a lot of followers.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.200
You seem rather popular.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.000
Yeah, fortunately.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.290
So does that mean

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:29.450
you're going to quit
once you can make a living being an idol?

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.450
Well, we've still got a long way to go
before that happens.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:36.500
Oh? So you'll stay on here then?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:37.870
Yeah.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:42.540
But there will come a time
when you have to choose.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.410
I suppose so.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:50.040
You can go on break now.
I have to place some orders.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.250
All right.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.040
I'm going on break, then.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:55.660
ACCOUNTING DEPARTMENT

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:56.910
Huh?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.620
Debt?

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:00.450
Yes.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.540
How much?

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.830
I owed 200,000 yen to the driver I hit.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:10.250
But it's a lot less now.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.750
You should consult me
about these things when they happen.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:19.830
I'm sorry.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.750
I'll cover it for you.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.250
How much is left?

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.790
What? Uh...

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:29.750
You can't quit
because you owe him money, right?

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:33.120
Isn't it better to pay it off
and quit as soon as possible?

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:34.410
How much?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:36.620
It's just...

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:41.790
Resolving my money problem
won't really change anything.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:42.910
What?

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:47.290
They're my friends, and we're doing
our best to achieve our dreams.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.200
Look, let's not get the wrong idea here.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.410
This is a company.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:02.540
I don't know a thing about your friends
and I don't care to.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.750
Which is your main job?

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:10.290
My accounting job at this company.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:14.290
And is falling asleep at work
part of your main job?

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.620
Quit acting like a spoiled brat.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:25.660
I bet you're enjoying life right now.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:32.330
You may feel reborn
after finding a new place to fit in,

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:34.950
but you have nowhere to run.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.580
Debts pile up before you know it

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.410
and debt collectors will come knocking.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:45.290
Will you be able to handle that?

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:51.830
You'll have to make a choice eventually.
What will you do then?

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.410
I...

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:59.750
When the time comes, I'll...

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.080
MANAKA

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:12.830
Hey, what are you doing?
We aren't finished here.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:16.450
When the time comes,
I'll give you my two weeks.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.330
Hey, wait.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.750
Please excuse me.
I have a private matter to attend to.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.200
Hey, manager?

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.620
Have you seen the OTM account?

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.500
You mean our official account?

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:48.080
I saw it this morning.
I updated our concert information.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:51.910
Not the official one, the fake one.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.830
You remember that fake account, right?

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.120
Ah, right, yes.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.330
Hurry up and check it out.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.830
Sorry, got to go. A customer came in.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.080
MANAKA, MIGGY, HIDARIN.
A TRIO BASED IN TOKYO!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:45.830
Hey.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:49.500
Hey.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.250
The curry from the other day
was delicious.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:56.870
Did you put it in the fridge
after it cooled down?

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.290
Yeah, I did.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:02.040
Good.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:07.040
About the other day... I'm sorry.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:15.290
I think it's just a timing problem.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:18.750
It happens sometimes. It is what it is.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.580
I'm also to blame for not being clear.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:26.040
The girl who came to your place is
from Accounting, isn't she?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.290
I'm sorry, I acted like a child.

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:33.450
I'll think it over carefully.

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:41.500
Please do.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:45.830
And try to be quick.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.290
I've asked for it to be deleted.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.330
However,

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:11.160
it's best to assume people
will figure out your address.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.540
What do you mean?

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:16.910
People with nothing better to do might
find your address and post it online.

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:21.370
What's more, the person
who took the photo already knows it.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:22.540
Right.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:26.950
But I have an auto-lock,
so I'll be fine as long as I'm careful.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:31.250
They're probably just an avid fan
and don't mean to be malicious.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.660
Not a chance!
They're a hella nasty sleazebag!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.250
-Language, Manaka.
-Language, Manaka.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:39.000
Harassment. Stalkers.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.250
Some outrageous things
have been done to idols.

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.330
It may be uncomfortable, but--

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.500
I'm fine.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.040
Huh?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.410
<i>This isn't a big deal.</i>

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:55.000
<i>This is where I'm meant to be.</i>

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.410
Okay, please step back.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.370
Please follow our instructions
and do not rush.

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:09.910
Follow the rules and shake hands in order!

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:13.540
You gave me the will to live!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.000
Thank you.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:18.250
Oh my gosh, I just love you so much.
I can't believe it!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:20.250
Thank you for your support.

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:22.700
<i>The people who come here</i>

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:26.250
<i>are genuinely happy</i>
<i>to shake hands with me.</i>

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:29.160
<i>They look at me</i>
<i>with sparkles in their eyes.</i>

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.790
<i>Every single one of them</i>
<i>is so warmhearted.</i>

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:40.620
100 tickets.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.950
A hundred?

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.700
Um, one handshake ticket
gives you three seconds, so...

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.410
100 tickets equals 300 seconds.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.700
Wow, that's a lot.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.330
I'm a big fan of yours.

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:01.330
Oh, um... Thank you very much.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.830
Miss Aggretsuko?

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.330
Yes?

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.750
You're not as aggressive
as people say, are you?

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.290
Excuse me?

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:15.950
Well...

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:22.250
Your music isn't very novel
and your lyrics are unintelligible.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:25.040
To be honest,
what you've mistaken for expression,

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:29.410
I don't believe merits much comment.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:33.910
If I may be so bold, I believe
that you are simply pining for attention.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.870
You're a simpleton and a letdown.
A paltry piece of trash.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:42.000
You're a bloodsucking machine
that extorts money from fans,

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:46.000
and an arrogant hag who thinks she gives
her fans dreams and the will to live.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:51.120
As a fan, I cannot help but feel pity.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.330
Only 30 seconds?

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.410
Five minutes is a long time, isn't it?

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.450
Subtitle translation by Rachel Momber
